  the GPL-3.0 text and the NOTICE file carrying the notices of the projects
  they derive from (Morphe, a hard fork of ReVanced, among others).
- The patches were applied with Morphe (https://github.com/MorpheApp).

No other code is added. The README, images and release workflow in this
